      "tokenized_text": "<C:0001,0004,>Vay be dostlar!<C:0003,0000,0A00>\nOh! Geldiniz!<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>O ikinci\n<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Rüya Yumurtası<C:0000,0003,000000FF>'nı getirdiniz mi?<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
